# Nothing here rewrites history.  The three ledgers stay append-only and their
# 16563 / 7598 / 10630-row predecessor prefixes are asserted byte-for-byte
# below.  Every historical gate keeps its own assertions verbatim and is simply
# replayed against the authenticated pre-batch13 preimage, which is rebuilt
# from the ledger's own original_text values and proved by the recorded
